    "status": "present",
    "value": "Data is split across worker machines, given here as one list of integers per worker. Return the value that occurs most often across all workers, choosing the smallest such value on a tie. The candidate simulates a distributed computation: each worker counts locally, the partial counts are sent to reducer workers chosen by value, each reducer reports its best value and the coordinator picks the overall best."
  },
